{"seq":4,"slug":"ethics-law","title":"七年级道德与法治","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law","introMarkdown":"# 七年级道德与法治 简介\n\n七年级道德与法治是初中思想品德教育的开篇，学生正值青春期的起始阶段，面临着身心发展的剧烈变化和全新的社会交往情境。这门课程帮助学生认识自我、理解规则、培养责任意识，为成长为合格公民打下思想基础。\n\n本内容共包含三个章节。第一章**青春成长**，围绕青春期的生理与心理变化展开，帮助学生正确认识自我、学会管理情绪，探讨友谊与师生关系的建立方式，引导学生以积极健康的心态面对成长中的困惑与挑战。第二章**法治意识**，从日常生活中的规则出发，介绍法律的基本特征与作用，讲解未成年人保护法、预防未成年人犯罪法等与初中生密切相关的法律知识，培养学生的法治观念和自我保护意识。第三章**公民责任**，引导学生认识个人与集体、个人与社会的关系，理解权利与义务的统一，培养学生对家庭、学校和社区的责任感，树立服务社会的意识。\n\n学习道德与法治需要将课本知识与生活实际紧密结合。建议关注身边的社会现象和新闻事件，用所学的道理去分析和思考。课堂讨论时积极表达自己的观点，同时学会倾听和尊重不同意见。法律知识部分要重视具体案例的分析，在案例中理解法律条文的实际含义。\n\n本内容适合七年级学生自学、课堂辅助教学和家长引导使用。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adolescent-growth","title":"青春期成长","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/adolescent-growth","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"self-identity","title":"七年级道德与法治 — 自我认同","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/adolescent-growth/self-identity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"peer-relationships","title":"七年级道德与法治 — 同伴关系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/adolescent-growth/peer-relationships"},{"seq":3,"slug":"emotion-management","title":"七年级道德与法治 — 情绪管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/adolescent-growth/emotion-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rule-of-law","title":"法治教育","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/rule-of-law","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"legal-awareness","title":"七年级道德与法治 — 法律意识","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/rule-of-law/legal-awareness"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rights-protection","title":"七年级道德与法治 — 权利保护","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/rule-of-law/rights-protection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-order","title":"七年级道德与法治 — 社会秩序","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/rule-of-law/social-order"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"civic-responsibility","title":"公民责任","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/civic-responsibility","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"community-participation","title":"七年级道德与法治 — 社区参与","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/civic-responsibility/community-participation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"environmental-duty","title":"七年级道德与法治 — 环境责任","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/civic-responsibility/environmental-duty"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cultural-identity","title":"七年级道德与法治 — 文化认同","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/ethics-law/civic-responsibility/cultural-identity"}]}]}